@HOTPATCH_CONFESSION_CONFIRM
PRINTFORML Confess your feelings to %CALLNAME:TARGET% and ask to become lovers?
IF FLAG:追加恋人枠 >= 150
	PRINTL You can have as many lovers as you want.
ELSE
	PRINTFORML You can currently have %PRINT_PLUR("lover", FLAG:追加恋人枠 + 1)%.
